  "name": "Mood and Feelings Questionnaire: Parent Report (MFQ-Parent)",
  "short_name": null,
  "language": "en",
  "description": "The Mood and Feelings Questionnaire (Short Version) – Parent Report (MFQ-Parent) is a 13-item measure assessing recent depressive symptomatology in children aged 6-17 years. The MFQ-Parent is parent-rated and asks the parent to report how their child has been feeling or acting in the past two weeks.",
